WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.159 --> 00:00:09.580
One-third of the population of China can't
speak the country's official language.

00:00:09.580 --> 00:00:17.810
4% of the sand on Normandy beaches is made
up of tiny metal particles from the D-Day

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:18.810
landings.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:23.960
In most countries, the most popular programme
on TV is the weather forecast.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:31.240
In 1983, 50 corporations controlled most of
the American media, including magazines, books,

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:36.510
music, news feeds, newspapers, movies, radio
and television.

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:39.989
By 1992 that number had dropped by half.

00:00:39.989 --> 00:00:47.320
By 2000, six corporations had ownership of
most media, and today just five dominate the

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:48.790
industry.

00:00:48.790 --> 00:00:53.989
Prunes were served as aphrodisiacs in Elizabethan
brothels.

00:00:53.989 --> 00:00:59.960
In Georgian, mama means 'father' and deda
means 'mother'.

00:00:59.960 --> 00:01:04.610
Most of the Italian extra virgin olive oil
sold in stores is not genuine.

00:01:04.610 --> 00:01:11.750
Nearly 70% of cheaper olive oil is not from
actual olives, but cut with cheaper seed oil

00:01:11.750 --> 00:01:16.210
to lower the price and much of the product
doesn't even come from Italy.

00:01:16.210 --> 00:01:20.320
The most common street name in the United
States is Second Street.

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:22.770
Main Street is second.

00:01:22.770 --> 00:01:28.370
Birds living in cities start the dawn chorus
five hours earlier than in the countryside.

00:01:28.370 --> 00:01:36.000
Frog juice, made by putting frogs in a blender,
is an aphrodisiac in Peru.

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:41.660
In 2000, it cost $3 billion to sequence a
human genome.

00:01:41.660 --> 00:01:47.130
By 2014, the cost had fallen to under $1,000.

00:01:47.130 --> 00:01:52.700
During the First World War, German and Russian
troops agreed a ceasefire and joined forces

00:01:52.700 --> 00:01:55.950
to fend off attacks by wolves.

00:01:55.950 --> 00:02:01.920
William Morton, the father of anaesthesia,
first experimented on himself but kept falling

00:02:01.920 --> 00:02:05.590
asleep before he could describe the results.

00:02:05.590 --> 00:02:11.090
Bill Murray was once pulled over by the Swedish
police for driving a golf cart under the influence

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:12.200
of alcohol.

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:18.180
20 million barrels of whisky are maturing
in warehouses in Scotland.

00:02:18.180 --> 00:02:24.820
Swedish programmer Ludvig Strigeus, the main
developer of Spotify, is also the programmer

00:02:24.820 --> 00:02:29.420
that made µTorrent.

